# JGMRPBot Environment Variables (v1.0.1)
#
# IMPORTANT:
# This project does NOT use dotenv or any .env file loader.
# You must set these as real environment variables before starting the bot.
#
# Examples:
#   export TOKEN=...
#   export DB_TYPE=SQLite
#   export DB_SQLITE_PATH=data/database.db
#
# Or put them in your shell profile / systemd unit / Docker env / etc.
# Never commit a real .env with secrets (it is already listed in .gitignore).

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Discord
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Required. Discord bot token from the Developer Portal.
TOKEN=your_discord_bot_token_here

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Database
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Required. "SQLite" (recommended for local/dev) or "Oracle" (production).
DB_TYPE=SQLite

# --- SQLite (when DB_TYPE=SQLite) ---
# Path to the database file. Defaults to data/database.db if unset.
DB_SQLITE_PATH=data/database.db

# --- Oracle (when DB_TYPE=Oracle) ---
# Leave blank when using SQLite.
DB_USER=
DB_PASSWORD=
# Code reads DB_CONNECT_STRING (README currently shows DB_CONNECTION_STRING).
DB_CONNECT_STRING=